125: ## 🚀 Python Source Installation & Setup
126: 
127: ### Prerequisites
128: - Python 3.9+ (Python 3.10+ recommended)
129: - Standard pip package manager
130: 
131: ### Setup
132: ```bash
133: # Clone the repository
134: git clone https://github.com/swastik-v1/NTFS-UM-Project-2.git
135: cd NTFS-UM-Project-2
136: 
137: # Install dependencies
138: pip install -r requirements.txt
139: ```
140: 
141: > **Note:** Cryptographic hashing relies on Python's built-in `hashlib` standard library module, requiring zero third-party downloads or external API access.
142: 
